<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51210" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vĭtŭlus</span></b> , i,
			m., and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vitŭla</span></b> , ae, f.
		Gr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰταλός</span>, bull; whence Italia;
			Sanscr. vatsas, calf, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>a calf.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(a).</b>
			<i>Masc.</i>, <i>a bullcalf</i>, <i><span class="en">Varr.
				R. R. 2, 5, 6</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cic. Div. 2, 15, 36</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Quint. 1, 9,
				5</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 2, 624</span></i>; <i><span class="en">4, 755</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">10, 227</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Mart. 3, 58, 11</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Verg. G.
				4, 299 al.</span></i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(b).</b>
			<i>Fem.</i>, <i>a cow-calf</i>, <i><span class="en">Verg. E. 3,
				29</span></i> and 77.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b> In gen., <i>a
				calf</i>, <i>foal;</i> of the horse, <i><span class="en">Verg. G. 3,
				164</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">of the elephant,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin. 8,
					1, 1, § 2</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">of the whale,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 9,
					6, 5, § 13</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b> In
			partic.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vitulus marinus,</span>”
				<i>a sea-calf</i>, <i>seal</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Juv.
					3, 238</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Suet. Aug. 90</span></i>.—Called
			also simply vitulus, <i><span class="en">Plin. 2, 55, 56, §
		146</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
